Diagrams with Mermaid Syntax |...","zh":"Mermaid Diagrams 设置指南 - 使用 Mermaid 语法创建图表","ja":"Mermaid Diagrams のベストプラクティス - AIエージェントを使用したグラフ作成","ko":"Mermaid Diagrams 설정 가이드 - Mermaid 구문으로 다이어그램 생성","es":"Guía de configuración de mermaid-diagrams para desarrolla...","fr":"Guide de mise en place de mermaid-diagrams pour les dével...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für mermaid-diagrams für Entwickler","pt":"Guia de Configuração de Mermaid Diagrams para Desenvolved...","ru":"Настройка Mermaid Диаграмм: Руководство для Разработчиков...","ar":"دليل إعداد Diagrams Mermaid لأصحاب المشاريع الإبداعية للأ..."},"description":{"en":"Discover how to create diagrams using Mermaid syntax with mermaid-diagrams. Learn to generate flowcharts, sequence diagrams, and more with this AI agent skill.","zh":"了解 Mermaid Diagrams 的功能和用途，使用 Mermaid 语法创建流程图、序列图、类图等","ja":"Mermaid Diagrams を使用して、フローチャート、シーケンス図、クラス図などを作成する方法を紹介します","ko":"Mermaid Diagrams 를 사용하여 다이어그램을 생성하고, Mermaid 구문으로 流程图、시퀀스图、클래스图 등을 만들 수 있습니다","es":"Aprende a generar diagramas con mermaid-diagrams y mejora tu productividad como desarrollador con esta herramienta de código abierto","fr":"Découvrez comment générer des diagrammes avec mermaid-diagrams et améliorez votre productivité en tant que développeur avec cet outil open source","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie mit mermaid-diagrams Diagramme generieren und Ihre Produktivität als Entwickler mit diesem Open-Source-Tool steigern","pt":"Aprenda a criar diagramas complexos com Mermaid. Descubra como usar a sintaxe Mermaid para gerar fluxogramas, sequências e mais","ru":"Узнайте, как создавать сложные диаграммы с помощью Mermaid. Откройте для себя, как использовать синтаксис Mermaid для генерации флоучартов, последовательност...","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء مخططات معقدة باستخدام Mermaid. اكتشف كيفية استخدام بناء الجملة Mermaid لإنشاء مخططات انسيابية وترتيب واكثر لادوات الذكية"},"definition":{"en":"mermaid-diagrams is a skill for generating diagrams using Mermaid syntax, rendering in markdown code blocks with the mermaid language identifier.","zh":"Mermaid Diagrams 是一种图表创建工具，使用 Mermaid 语法来创建和连接内容","ja":"Mermaid Diagrams は、グラフを作成するためのツールで、Mermaid 構文を使用します","ko":"Mermaid Diagrams 는 다이어그램을 생성하는 도구로, Mermaid 구문으로 내용을 생성하고 연결합니다","es":"Mermaid-diagrams es una herramienta de código abierto para generar diagramas de flujo, secuencia, clase y estado","fr":"Mermaid-diagrams est un outil open source pour générer des diagrammes de flux, de séquence, de classe et d''état","de":"Mermaid-diagrams ist ein Open-Source-Tool zum Erstellen von Fluss-, Sequenz-, Klassen- und Zustandsdiagrammen","pt":"Mermaid Diagrams é uma ferramenta de diagramação que usa sintaxe Mermaid para criar fluxogramas, sequências e outros tipos de diagramas","ru":"Mermaid Diagrams - это инструмент диаграммирования, который использует синтаксис Mermaid для создания флоучартов, последовательностей и других типов диаграмм для ИИ Агентов","ar":"Mermaid Diagrams هو أداة مخططات تستخدم بناء الجملة Mermaid لإنشاء مخططات انسيابية وترتيب واكثر لادوات الذكية"},"features":{"en":["Generates flowcharts for process flow and decision trees","Supports sequence diagrams for API calls and system interactions","Creates class diagrams for OOP structure and domain models","Renders state diagrams for state machines and workflows","Generates ER diagrams for database schemas and data relationships","Supports C4 model diagrams for software architecture"],"zh":["支持流程图、序列图、类图等多种图表类型","使用 Mermaid 语法创建图表","支持 Zettelkasten 样式 wiki 链接","可创建流程图、决策树、API 调用图等","支持 OOP 结构、域模型等图表类型","可创建状态机、工作流等图表"],"ja":["フローチャート、シーケンス図、クラス図など多種多様なグラフタイプをサポート","Mermaid 構文を使用してグラフを作成","ZettelkastenスタイルのWikiリンクをサポート","フローチャート、決策ツリー、API呼び出し図などを作成可能","OOP構造、ドメインモデルなどグラフタイプをサポート","ステートマシン、ワークフローなどグラフを作成可能"],"ko":["流程图、시퀀스图、클래스图 등 多种 다이어그램 유형을 지원","Mermaid 구문으로 다이어그램을 생성","Zettelkasten 스타일 wiki 링크를 지원","流程图、결정 트리、API 호출图 등を作成할 수 있습니다","OOP 구조、도메인 모델 등 다이어그램 유형을 지원","상태 기계、워크플로우 등 다이어그램을 생성할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Generación de diagramas de flujo con Mermaid","Soporte para diagramas de secuencia y clase","Creación de diagramas de estado y ER","Compatibilidad con markdown y código abierto","Uso de la sintaxis Mermaid para la generación de diagramas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como React y Python"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes de flux avec Mermaid","Prise en charge des diagrammes de séquence et de classe","Création de diagrammes d''état et ER","Compatibilité avec markdown et open source","Utilisation de la syntaxe Mermaid pour la génération de diagrammes","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que React et Python"],"de":["Erstellung von Flussdiagrammen mit Mermaid","Unterstützung für Sequenz- und Klassendiagramme","Erstellung von Zustands- und ER-Diagrammen","Kompatibilität mit markdown und Open Source","Verwendung der Mermaid-Syntax für die Diagrammerstellung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Python"],"pt":["Geração de fluxogramas usando sintaxe Mermaid","Criação de sequências para API calls e interações de sistema","Suporte a diagramas de classe para estruturas de OOP","Geração de diagramas de estado para máquinas de estado e fluxos de trabalho","Suporte a diagramas de entidade-relacionamento para esquemas de banco de dados"],"ru":["Генерация флоучартов с помощью синтаксиса Mermaid","Создание последовательностей для API вызовов и системных взаимодействий для ИИ Агентов","Поддержка диаграмм классов для структур OOP","Генерация диаграмм состояний для конечных автоматов и рабочих процессов","Поддержка диаграмм сущность-связь для схем баз данных"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات انسيابية باستخدام بناء الجملة Mermaid","إنشاء ترتيب لنداءات API والتفاعلات النظامية لأدوات الذكية","دعم مخططات الفصل للهياكل الكائنية","إنشاء مخططات الحالة للألات الحالة والتدفقات العملية","دعم مخططات الكيان-العلاقة لنسخ قواعد البيانات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use mermaid-diagrams","mermaid-diagrams alternative","mermaid-diagrams setup guide","what is mermaid-diagrams","mermaid-diagrams vs graphviz","mermaid-diagrams install","mermaid syntax tutorial","generating diagrams with mermaid","mermaid diagrams for developers"],"zh":["Mermaid Diagrams","Mermaid 语法","图表创建工具","流程图","序列图","类图","Zettelkasten","wiki 链接","AI 工具","开发工具"],"ja":["Mermaid Diagrams","Mermaid 構文","グラフ作成ツール","フローチャート","シーケンス図","クラス図","Zettelkasten","Wiki リンク","AI エージェント","開発ツール"],"ko":["Mermaid Diagrams","Mermaid 구문","다이어그램 생성 도구","流程图","시퀀스图","클래스图","Zettelkasten","wiki 링크","AI 에이전트","개발 도구"],"es":["mermaid-diagrams","generación de diagramas","desarrollo de software","herramientas de código abierto","React","Python","markdown","diagramas de flujo","diagramas de secuencia","diagramas de clase"],"fr":["mermaid-diagrams","génération de diagrammes","développement de logiciels","outils open source","React","Python","markdown","diagrammes de flux","diagrammes de séquence","diagrammes de classe"],"de":["mermaid-diagrams","Erstellung von Diagrammen","Softwareentwicklung","Open-Source-Tools","React","Python","markdown","Flussdiagramme","Sequenzdiagramme","Klassendiagramme"],"pt":["mermaid diagrams","sintaxe mermaid","fluxogramas","sequências","diagramas de classe","diagramas de estado","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de diagramação"],"ru":["mermaid диаграммы","синтаксис mermaid","флоучарты","последовательности","диаграммы классов","диаграммы состояний","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты диаграммирования для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["مخططات mermaid","بناء الجملة mermaid","مخططات انسيابية","ترتيب","مخططات الفصل","مخططات الحالة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات مخططات لادوات الذكية"]}},"owner":"alexanderop","repo":"second-brain-nuxt","repoPath":"alexanderop/second-brain-nuxt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.311Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mermaid-diagrams","description":"Generate Mermaid diagrams (flowcharts, sequence, class, state, ER, C4, mindmaps, gitgraph). Use when asked to create diagrams, visualize processes, document architecture, or explain systems visually. Triggers include diagram, flowchart, sequence diagram, class diagram, state diagram, ER diagram, C4, mindmap, gitgraph, visualize, draw.","bodyPreview":"# Mermaid Diagrams\n\nGenerate diagrams using Mermaid syntax. All diagrams render in markdown code blocks with `mermaid` language identifier.\n\n## Decision Guide\n\n| Use Case | Diagram Type |\n|----------|--------------|\n| Process flow, decision trees | Flowchart |\n| API calls, system interactions over time | Sequence |\n| OOP structure, domain models | Class |\n| State machines, workflows | State |\n| Database schemas, data relationships | ER |\n| Software architecture (C4 model) | C4 |\n| Brainstorming,","body":"# Mermaid Diagrams\n\nGenerate diagrams using Mermaid syntax. All diagrams render in markdown code blocks with `mermaid` language identifier.\n\n## Decision Guide\n\n| Use Case | Diagram Type |\n|----------|--------------|\n| Process flow, decision trees | Flowchart |\n| API calls, system interactions over time | Sequence |\n| OOP structure, domain models | Class |\n| State machines, workflows | State |\n| Database schemas, data relationships | ER |\n| Software architecture (C4 model) | C4 |\n| Brainstorming, hierarchical organization | Mindmap |\n| Git branching, commit history | GitGraph |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Start] --> B{Decision}\n    B -->|Yes| C[Action 1]\n    B -->|No| D[Action 2]\n    C --> E[End]\n    D --> E\n```\n\n### Sequence\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant U as User\n    participant S as Server\n    U->>S: Request\n    S-->>U: Response\n```\n\n### Class\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    Animal <|-- Dog\n    Animal : +String name\n    Animal : +makeSound()\n    Dog : +fetch()\n```\n\n### State\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> Idle\n    Idle --> Processing: start\n    Processing --> Done: complete\n    Done --> [*]\n```\n\n### ER\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n    ORDER ||--|{ LINE-ITEM : contains\n```\n\n### C4 Context\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n    Person(user, \"User\", \"End user\")\n    System(app, \"Application\", \"Main system\")\n    Rel(user, app, \"Uses\")\n```\n\n### Mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Topic))\n    Branch A\n      Leaf 1\n      Leaf 2\n    Branch B\n```\n\n### GitGraph\n```mermaid\ngitgraph\n    commit\n    branch feature\n    commit\n    checkout main\n    merge feature\n```\n\n---\n\n## Flowchart Reference\n\n**Directions:** `TD` (top-down), `LR` (left-right), `BT` (bottom-top), `RL` (right-left)\n\n### Node Shapes\n\n| Shape | Syntax | Example |\n|-------|--------|---------|\n| Rectangle | `[text]` | `A[Process]` |\n| Rounded | `(text)` | `A(Start)` |\n| Stadium | `([text])` | `A([Terminal])` |\n| Diamond | `{text}` | `A{Decision}` |\n| Circle | `((text))` | `A((Event))` |\n| Hexagon | `{{text}}` | `A{{Prepare}}` |\n| Cylinder | `[(text)]` | `A[(Database)]` |\n| Subroutine | `[[text]]` | `A[[Subprocess]]` |\n| Parallelogram | `[/text/]` | `A[/Input/]` |\n| Trapezoid | `[\\text\\]` | `A[\\Manual Op\\]` |\n\n### Link Types\n\n| Type | Syntax | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| Arrow | `-->` | Solid with arrowhead |\n| Open | `---` | Solid, no arrowhead |\n| Dotted arrow | `-.->` | Dotted with arrowhead |\n| Thick arrow | `==>` | Thick with arrowhead |\n| With text | `--\\|text\\|>` | Label on link |\n| Multi-length | `---->` | Longer link (more ranks) |\n\n### Subgraphs\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph Backend[\"Backend Services\"]\n        direction LR\n        API --> DB[(Database)]\n    end\n    Client --> API\n```\n\n### Styling\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Node]:::highlight\n    classDef highlight fill:#ff9,stroke:#333\n    style A stroke-width:2px\n```\n\n---\n\n## Sequence Diagram Reference\n\n### Arrow Types\n\n| Syntax | Style |\n|--------|-------|\n| `->>` | Solid with arrowhead |\n| `-->>` | Dotted with arrowhead |\n| `-x` | Solid with cross |\n| `-)` | Async (open arrow) |\n| `<<->>` | Bidirectional |\n\n### Participants\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    actor User\n    participant API as API Server\n    participant DB as Database\n```\n\n### Activations\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    User->>+API: Request\n    API->>+DB: Query\n    DB-->>-API: Result\n    API-->>-User: Response\n```\n\n### Control Flow\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    alt Success\n        A->>B: OK\n    else Failure\n        A->>B: Error\n    end\n\n    loop Every 5s\n        A->>B: Ping\n    end\n\n    opt Optional\n        A->>B: Maybe\n    end\n```\n\n### Notes\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    Note right of A: Single note\n    Note over A,B: Spanning note\n```\n\n### Grouping with Boxes\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    box Blue Frontend\n        participant U as User\n        participant W as Web\n    end\n    box Green Backend\n        participant A as API\n    end\n```\n\n---\n\n## Class Diagram Reference\n\n### Visibility Modifiers\n\n| Symbol | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| `+` | Public |\n| `-` | Private |\n| `#` | Protected |\n| `~` | Package |\n\n### Relationships\n\n| Type | Syntax | Meaning |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| Inheritance | `<\\|--` | Extends |\n| Composition | `*--` | Strong owns |\n| Aggregation | `o--` | Weak owns |\n| Association | `-->` | Uses |\n| Dependency | `..>` | Depends on |\n| Realization | `..\\|>` | Implements |\n\n### Full Example\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    class Animal {\n        <<abstract>>\n        +String name\n        +int age\n        +makeSound()* void\n    }\n    class Dog {\n        +String breed\n        +fetch() void\n    }\n    Animal <|-- Dog\n    Dog \"1\" --> \"*\" Toy : plays with\n```\n\n### Generics\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    class List~T~ {\n        +add(T item)\n        +T get(int index)\n    }\n```\n\n### Annotations\n- `<<interface>>` - Interface\n- `<<abstract>>` - Abstract class\n- `<<service>>` - Service class\n- `<<enumeration>>` - Enum\n\n---\n\n## State Diagram Reference\n\n### Basic Syntax\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> State1\n    State1 --> State2: trigger\n    State2 --> [*]\n```\n\n### Composite States\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    state Active {\n        [*] --> Running\n        Running --> Paused: pause\n        Paused --> Running: resume\n    }\n    [*] --> Active\n    Active --> [*]: stop\n```\n\n### Fork and Join\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    state fork <<fork>>\n    state join <<join>>\n    [*] --> fork\n    fork --> Task1\n    fork --> Task2\n    Task1 --> join\n    Task2 --> join\n    join --> [*]\n```\n\n### Choice\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    state check <<choice>>\n    [*] --> check\n    check --> Success: valid\n    check --> Error: invalid\n```\n\n### Notes\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    State1\n    note right of State1\n        Description here\n    end note\n```\n\n---\n\n## ER Diagram Reference\n\n### Cardinality\n\n| Left | Right | Meaning |\n|------|-------|---------|\n| `\\|o` | `o\\|` | Zero or one |\n| `\\|\\|` | `\\|\\|` | Exactly one |\n| `}o` | `o{` | Zero or more |\n| `}\\|` | `\\|{` | One or more |\n\n### Relationship Types\n- `--` Identifying (solid line, child depends on parent)\n- `..` Non-identifying (dashed line, independent entities)\n\n### Attributes\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    USER {\n        int id PK\n        string email UK\n        string name\n        datetime created_at\n    }\n    POST {\n        int id PK\n        int user_id FK\n        string title\n        text content\n    }\n    USER ||--o{ POST : writes\n```\n\n---\n\n## C4 Diagram Reference\n\nC4 provides 4 levels of abstraction for architecture documentation.\n\n### Diagram Types\n- `C4Context` - System context (level 1)\n- `C4Container` - Container diagram (level 2)\n- `C4Component` - Component diagram (level 3)\n- `C4Dynamic` - Interaction sequences\n- `C4Deployment` - Infrastructure layout\n\n### Elements\n\n| Element | Syntax | Use |\n|---------|--------|-----|\n| Person | `Person(alias, label, desc)` | Users |\n| Person_Ext | `Person_Ext(...)` | External users |\n| System | `System(alias, label, desc)` | Software systems |\n| System_Ext | `System_Ext(...)` | External systems |\n| SystemDb | `SystemDb(...)` | Database systems |\n| Container | `Container(alias, label, tech, desc)` | Applications |\n| ContainerDb | `ContainerDb(...)` | Container databases |\n| Component | `Component(alias, label, tech, desc)` | Internal parts |\n\n### Boundaries\n```mermaid\nC4Container\n    System_Boundary(app, \"Application\") {\n        Container(web, \"Web App\", \"React\")\n        Container(api, \"API\", \"Node.js\")\n        ContainerDb(db, \"Database\", \"PostgreSQL\")\n    }\n    Rel(web, api, \"HTTP/JSON\")\n    Rel(api, db, \"SQL\")\n```\n\n### Relationships\n- `Rel(from, to, label)` - Standard relationship\n- `Rel_U/D/L/R(...)` - Directional hints\n- `BiRel(from, to, label)` - Bidirectional\n\n### Complete C4 Context Example\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n    Person(user, \"Customer\", \"Uses the system\")\n    System(app, \"E-Commerce\", \"Online store\")\n    System_Ext(payment, \"Payment Gateway\", \"Processes payments\")\n    System_Ext(shipping, \"Shipping API\", \"Handles delivery\")\n\n    Rel(user, app, \"Browses, orders\")\n    Rel(app, payment, \"Processes payments\")\n    Rel(app, shipping, \"Ships orders\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mindmap Reference\n\nUses indentation for hierarchy. Root node required.\n\n### Node Shapes\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n    root((Central Topic))\n        [Square]\n        (Rounded)\n        ))Cloud((\n        {{Hexagon}}\n```\n\n### With Icons\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n    root((Project))\n        Tasks ::icon(fa fa-tasks)\n        Team ::icon(fa fa-users)\n```\n\n### Styling\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n    root\n        Important:::urgent\n        Normal\n```\n\n---\n\n## GitGraph Reference\n\n### Basic Operations\n```mermaid\ngitgraph\n    commit id: \"initial\"\n    commit id: \"feature\"\n    branch develop\n    commit\n    checkout main\n    merge develop tag: \"v1.0\"\n```\n\n### Commit Types\n- `type: NORMAL` - Default\n- `type: HIGHLIGHT` - Emphasized\n- `type: REVERSE` - Reverted\n\n### Full Example\n```mermaid\ngitgraph\n    commit id: \"init\"\n    branch feature\n    commit id: \"add-login\"\n    commit id: \"add-logout\" type: HIGHLIGHT\n    checkout main\n    commit id: \"hotfix\" type: REVERSE\n    merge feature tag: \"v1.0\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### DO\n- Keep diagrams focused (one concept per diagram)\n- Use clear, descriptive labels\n- Add direction hints (`TD`, `LR`) explicitly\n- Use subgraphs/boundaries for grouping\n- Include legends for complex diagrams\n\n### DON''T\n- Overcrowd with too many nodes (>15-20)\n- Use cryptic single-letter IDs without labels\n- Mix multiple concerns in one diagram\n- Rely on auto-layout for complex diagrams\n\n### Layout Tips\n- **Flowchart**: `LR` for processes, `TD` for hierarchies\n- **Sequence**: Order participants by interaction frequency\n- **Class**: Group related classes with namespaces\n- **C4**: Start with Context, drill down to Container/Component\n- **ER**: Place central entities in the middle\n\n### Common Fixes\n| Problem | Solution |\n|---------|----------|\n| Nodes overlap | Reduce node count, use subgraphs |\n| Links cross confusingly | Reorder nodes, change direction |\n| Text truncated | Use aliases: `A[Long Name] as short` |\n| Diagram too wide | Switch `LR` to `TD` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:33.956Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents and Developer Agents needing advanced diagram generation capabilities using Mermaid syntax.","zh":"非常适合需要高级图表生成功能的技术写作代理和开发代理，使用Mermaid语法。","ja":"Mermaid構文を使用して高度なダイアグラム生成機能が必要なテクニカルライティングエージェントとデベロッパーエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Mermaid 구문을 사용하여 고급 다이어그램 생성 기능이 필요한 기술 문서 에이전트와 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Escritura Técnica y Agentes de Desarrolladores que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de diagramas utilizando la sintaxis Mermaid.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''écriture technique et les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de génération de diagrammes avancées utilisant la syntaxe Mermaid.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten und Entwickleragenten, die erweiterte Diagrammgenerierungsfunktionen mit Mermaid-Syntax benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica e Agentes de Desenvolvedores que precisam de capacidades avançadas de geração de diagramas usando a sintaxe Mermaid.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технической документации и разработчиков, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности генерации диаграмм с использованием синтаксиса Mermaid.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكتابيين الفنيين ووكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء المخططات باستخدام بناء الجملة Mermaid."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate flowcharts, sequence diagrams, and class diagrams using markdown code blocks with the `mermaid` language identifier, supporting various diagram types like flowcharts, sequence diagrams, and more, utilizing Mermaid syntax for technical documentation and developer workflows.","zh":"赋予代理生成流程图、序列图和类图的能力，使用markdown代码块和`mermaid`语言标识符，支持各种图表类型，例如流程图、序列图等，利用Mermaid语法用于技术文档和开发工作流。","ja":"エージェントがフローチャート、シーケンス図、クラス図を生成する機能を提供します。マークダウンコードブロックと`mermaid`言語識別子を使用して、フローチャート、シーケンス図などの様々なダイアグラムタイプをサポートし、Mermaid構文を使用して技術文書と開発ワークフローをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 흐름도, 시퀀스 다이어그램, 클래스 다이어그램을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 마크다운 코드 블록과 `mermaid` 언어 식별자를 사용하여 흐름도, 시퀀스 다이어그램 등의 다양한 다이어그램 유형을 지원하며, Mermaid 구문을 사용하여 기술 문서와 개발 워크플로우를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar diagramas de flujo, diagramas de secuencia y diagramas de clase utilizando bloques de código markdown con el identificador de lenguaje `mermaid`, que admite varios tipos de diagramas como diagramas de flujo, diagramas de secuencia y más, utilizando la sintaxis Mermaid para la documentación técnica y los flujos de trabajo de los desarrolladores.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes de flux, des diagrammes de séquence et des diagrammes de classe en utilisant des blocs de code markdown avec l''identifiant de langage `mermaid`, qui prend en charge les différents types de diagrammes tels que les diagrammes de flux, les diagrammes de séquence et plus encore, en utilisant la syntaxe Mermaid pour la documentation technique et les flux de travail des développeurs.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Flussdiagramme, Sequenzdiagramme und Klassendiagramme zu generieren, indem sie Markdown-Codeblöcke mit dem Sprachidentifikator `mermaid` verwenden, der verschiedene Diagrammtypen wie Flussdiagramme, Sequenzdiagramme und mehr unterstützt, unter Verwendung der Mermaid-Syntax für technische Dokumentation und Entwickler-Workflows.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar fluxogramas, diagramas de sequência e diagramas de classe usando blocos de código markdown com o identificador de linguagem `mermaid`, suportando vários tipos de diagramas como fluxogramas, diagramas de sequência e mais, utilizando a sintaxe Mermaid para documentação técnica e fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvedores.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать блок-схемы, диаграммы последовательности и диаграммы классов, используя блоки кода markdown с идентификатором языка `mermaid`, поддерживая различные типы диаграмм, такие как блок-схемы, диаграммы последовательности и многое другое, используя синтаксис Mermaid для технической документации и рабочих процессов разработчиков.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مخططات انسيابية ومخططات تسلسل ومخططات فئات باستخدام كتل من код التدوين الخفيف مع معرّف لغة `mermaid`، ودعم أنواع مختلفة من المخططات مثل مخططات الانسياب ومخططات التسلسل وغيرها، باستخدام بناء الجملة Mermaid للوثائق الفنية وعمليات العمل للمطورين."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating flowcharts for process flows and decision trees","Creating sequence diagrams for API calls and system interactions","Debugging class diagrams for OOP structure and domain models"],"zh":["为过程流和决策树生成流程图","为API调用和系统交互创建序列图","调试类图以查看OOP结构和域模型"],"ja":["プロセスフローと決定木のフローチャートを生成する","API呼び出しとシステムのやり取りのシーケンス図を作成する","OOP構造とドメインモデルを確認するためにクラス図をデバッグする"],"ko":["프로세스 흐름과 결정 트리의 흐름도를 생성하기","API 호출과 시스템 상호 작용의 시퀀스 다이어그램을 생성하기","OOP 구조와 도메인 모델을 확인하기 위해 클래스 다이어그램을 디버깅하기"],"es":["Generación de diagramas de flujo para flujos de procesos y árboles de decisión","Creación de diagramas de secuencia para llamadas a API y interacciones de sistema","Depuración de diagramas de clase para estructura OOP y modelos de dominio"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes de flux pour les flux de processus et les arbres de décision","Création de diagrammes de séquence pour les appels d''API et les interactions de système","Débogage de diagrammes de classe pour la structure OOP et les modèles de domaine"],"de":["Generierung von Flussdiagrammen für Prozessflüsse und Entscheidungsbäume","Erstellung von Sequenzdiagrammen für API-Aufrufe und Systeminteraktionen","Fehlerbehebung von Klassendiagrammen für OOP-Struktur und Domänenmodelle"],"pt":["Gerar fluxogramas para fluxos de processos e árvores de decisão","Criar diagramas de sequência para chamadas de API e interações de sistema","Depurar diagramas de classe para estrutura OOP e modelos de domínio"],"ru":["Генерировать блок-схемы для потоков процессов и деревьев решений","Создавать диаграммы последовательности для вызовов API и взаимодействий системы","Отлаживать диаграммы классов для структуры OOP и моделей домена"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات انسيابية لتدفقات العمليات وأشجار القرار","إنشاء مخططات تسلسل لدعوات واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية وتفاعلات النظام","تصحيح مخططات الفئات لهياكل البرمجة الكائنية والتطبيقات النمطية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Mermaid syntax knowledge","Limited to supported diagram types (e.g., flowchart, sequence, class, state, ER, C4)"],"zh":["需要Mermaid语法知识","仅限支持的图表类型（例如，流程图，序列图，类图，状态图，ER图，C4图）"],"ja":["Mermaid構文の知識が必要","サポートされているダイアグラムタイプ（例：フローチャート、シーケンス図、クラス図、状態図、ER図、C4図）に限定される"],"ko":["Mermaid 구문 지식이 필요합니다","지원되는 다이어그램 유형（예：흐름도, 시퀀스 다이어그램, 클래스 다이어그램, 상태 다이어그램, ER 다이어그램, C4 다이어그램）에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la sintaxis Mermaid","Limitado a los tipos de diagramas admitidos (por ejemplo, diagrama de flujo, secuencia, clase, estado, ER, C4)"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en syntaxe Mermaid","Limité aux types de diagrammes pris en charge (par exemple, diagramme de flux, séquence, classe, état, ER, C4)"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Mermaid-Syntax","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Diagrammtypen (z. B. Flussdiagramm, Sequenz, Klasse, Zustand, ER, C4)"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da sintaxe Mermaid","Limitado a tipos de diagramas suportados (por exemplo, fluxograma, sequência, classe, estado, ER, C4)"],"ru":["Требует знания синтаксиса Mermaid","Ограничен поддерживаемыми типами диаграмм (например, блок-схема, последовательность, класс, состояние, ER, C4)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بناء الجملة Mermaid","محدود بنوعيات المخططات المدعومة (على سبيل المثال مخطط الانسياب ومخطط التسلسل وفئة الحالة والكائنات والنمذجة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"16429fea364ce18ddf284d366f073ca2379b9af49f75471cb46e9a753e709d6a","qualityScore":45}');
