ナルナレッジマネジメントアプローチ","ko":"RCR Backend는 로컬 우선의 개인 지식 관리 방법","es":"rcr-backend es un agente de AI que utiliza un enfoque de código abierto para la gestión de conocimiento personal","fr":"rcr-backend est un agent de l''IA qui utilise une approche de code ouvert pour la gestion des connaissances personnelles","de":"rcr-backend ist ein KI-Agent, der einen Open-Source-Ansatz für die persönliche Wissensverwaltung verwendet","pt":"O que é RCR Backend? Uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de conhecimento pessoal que utiliza Drizzle ORM e TypeScript","ru":"Что такое RCR Backend? Инструмент личного управления знаниями, который использует Drizzle ORM и TypeScript","ar":"ما هو RCR Backend؟ أداة إدارة المعرفة الشخصية التي تستخدم Drizzle ORM وTypeScript"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes Drizzle v2 query syntax for reads via db.query.<table>.findMany/findFirst","Provides object-style where, built-in with for relations, and columns selection","Supports mutations via db.insert(), db.update(), and db.delete() with upsert capability","Avoids raw SQL in favor of query builder APIs","Enables external-source data handling"],"zh":["使用Drizzle ORM实现高效查询","支持对象式where和with","避免使用raw SQL","支持upsert和onConflictDoUpdate","提供mutation操作"],"ja":["Drizzle ORMを使用した効率的なクエリ","オブジェクトスタイルのwhereとwithをサポート","raw SQLの使用を避ける","upsertとonConflictDoUpdateをサポート","mutation操作を提供"],"ko":["Drizzle ORM을 사용한 효율적인 쿼리","객체 스타일의 where와 with를 지원","raw SQL의 사용을 피함","upsert와 onConflictDoUpdate를 지원","mutation操作을 제공"],"es":["Utiliza Drizzle ORM v2 para consultas de lectura","Proporciona un estilo de objeto para la cláusula where","Incluye una función de selección de columnas","Evita el uso de SQL crudo","Utiliza la API de constructor de consultas en su lugar"],"fr":["Utilise Drizzle ORM v2 pour les requêtes de lecture","Fournit un style d''objet pour la clause where","Inclut une fonction de sélection de colonnes","Évite l''utilisation de SQL brut","Utilise l''API de constructeur de requêtes à la place"],"de":["Verwendet Drizzle ORM v2 für Leseabfragen","Bietet einen Objektstil für die Where-Klausel","Enthält eine Funktion zur Spaltenauswahl","Vermeidet die Verwendung von rohem SQL","Verwendet die Query-Builder-API anstelle von"],"pt":["Utiliza Drizzle ORM v2 para consultas de leitura","Suporta sintaxe de consulta de objeto com `where`, `with` e `columns`","Evita SQL bruto com uso de APIs de construção de consultas","Inclui mutações com `db.insert()`, `db.update()` e `db.delete()`","Suporta upsert com `.onConflictDoUpdate()` em inserções"],"ru":["Использует Drizzle ORM v2 для запросов на чтение","Поддерживает объектно-ориентированный синтаксис запроса с `where`, `with` и `columns`","Избегает сырого SQL с использованием API построения запросов","Включает мутации с `db.insert()`, `db.update()` и `db.delete()`","Поддерживает upsert с `.onConflictDoUpdate()` при вставках"],"ar":["يستخدم Drizzle ORM v2 لاستعلامات القراءة","يدعم بناء استعلام كائنية مع `where` و `with` و `columns`","يتجنب SQL الخام باستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات لإنشاء الاستعلامات","يشمل التغييرات مع `db.insert()` و `db.update()` و `db.delete()`","يدعم upsert مع `.onConflictDoUpdate()` عند الإدخالات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use rcr-backend","rcr-backend drizzle orm","rcr-backend alternative","rcr-backend setup guide","what is rcr-backend","rcr-backend vs barnsworthburning","rcr-backend install","local-first personal knowledge management"],"zh":["RCR Backend","AIエージェント","本地数据管理","Drizzle ORM","typescript","query builder","mutation","upsert","onConflictDoUpdate"],"ja":["RCR Backend","AIエージェント","ローカルファースト","Drizzle ORM","typescript","query builder","mutation","upsert","onConflictDoUpdate"],"ko":["RCR Backend","AI 에이전트","로컬 데이터 관리","Drizzle ORM","typescript","query builder","mutation","upsert","onConflictDoUpdate"],"es":["rcr-backend","Drizzle ORM","TypeScript","gestión de conocimiento personal","agente de AI","herramientas de desarrollo","configuración de rcr-backend","guía de inicio rápido","mejores prácticas para rcr-backend"],"fr":["rcr-backend","Drizzle ORM","TypeScript","gestion des connaissances personnelles","agent de l''IA","outils de développement","configuration de rcr-backend","guide de démarrage rapide","meilleures pratiques pour rcr-backend"],"de":["rcr-backend","Drizzle ORM","TypeScript","persönliche Wissensverwaltung","KI-Agent","Entwicklungstools","Konfiguration von rcr-backend","Schnellstartanleitung","Best Practices für rcr-backend"],"pt":["RCR Backend","Drizzle ORM","TypeScript","gerenciamento de conhecimento pessoal","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","RCR Backend guia de configuração","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["RCR Backend","Drizzle ORM","TypeScript","личное управление знаниями","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","RCR Backend настройка","лучшие практики разработки ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["RCR Backend","Drizzle ORM","TypeScript","إدارة المعرفة الشخصية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","RCR Backend دليل الإعداد","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Aias","repo":"red-cliff-record","repoPath":"Aias/red-cliff-record","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.328Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rcr-backend","description":"Database, API, and integration conventions for Red Cliff Record. Use when working with Drizzle ORM, tRPC routers, database migrations, integration syncs, or media alt-text workflows in this project. Triggers on database queries, API routes, Drizzle v2, tRPC, Zod validation, integration work, or `rcr media` commands.","bodyPreview":"# RCR Backend\n\nSupplements global `typescript-guidelines` skill.\n\n## Drizzle ORM\n\n- **Always use Drizzle v2 query syntax** for reads: `db.query.<table>.findMany/findFirst` (not `db.select().from()`)\n  - Provides object-style `where`, built-in `with` for relations, and `columns` selection\n- Avoid raw SQL — use query builder APIs instead of `sql` template literals\n- Mutations: `db.insert()`, `db.update()`, `db.delete()`\n- Always upsert with `.onConflictDoUpdate()` on insertions\n- External-source P","body":"# RCR Backend\n\nSupplements global `typescript-guidelines` skill.\n\n## Drizzle ORM\n\n- **Always use Drizzle v2 query syntax** for reads: `db.query.<table>.findMany/findFirst` (not `db.select().from()`)\n  - Provides object-style `where`, built-in `with` for relations, and `columns` selection\n- Avoid raw SQL — use query builder APIs instead of `sql` template literals\n- Mutations: `db.insert()`, `db.update()`, `db.delete()`\n- Always upsert with `.onConflictDoUpdate()` on insertions\n- External-source PKs: `integer(''id'').primaryKey()` (not `serial`)\n- Never edit Drizzle meta files (`snapshot.json`, `_journal.json`) — they''re generated by `drizzle-kit`\n\n## tRPC\n\n- Routers live in `src/server/api/routers/`\n- Zod v4 for input validation\n- Client hooks from `src/app/trpc.ts`\n- Invalidate queries after mutations\n\n## Integrations\n\nCanonical guide: `INTEGRATIONS.md`.\n\n- Sync logic wrapped by `runIntegration`; exposed via `rcr sync <name>`\n- File convention: `types.ts` (Zod schemas), `client.ts` (API client), `sync.ts` (orchestration)\n- Respect rate limits; batch where needed; upsert for idempotency\n\n## Database Management\n\nCanonical operations: `README.md` and `src/server/db/db-manager.sh`.\n\n- `bun run db:generate` to generate migration files (safe for agent)\n- `bun run db:studio` for database inspection\n- Never run migrations (`bun run db:migrate`, `bunx drizzle-kit migrate`) — always provide the command for the user to run\n- Never run destructive operations without explicit user permission\n- Backups are named by environment (`prod-{timestamp}.dump`, `dev-{timestamp}.dump`), not database name\n\n## Agent Workflow: Media Alt Text\n\nThe `rcr media` commands support CLI-based alt text updates. Workflow for looped agents:\n\n1. **List** images needing alt text:\n   ```bash\n   rcr media list --type=image --alt-text=false --limit=100 --order=recordCreatedAt\n   ```\n2. **Get** item with parent record context:\n   ```bash\n   rcr media get <id> --with-record\n   ```\n   Returns media item plus `record: { id, title, type, mediaCaption, url }`.\n3. **Update**:\n   ```bash\n   rcr media update <id> ''{\"altText\": \"Description of the image\"}''\n   ```\n\n**Parallel processing**: pre-assign media IDs per agent to avoid overlap. Parent fetches a batch, splits into chunks, each subagent processes its assigned IDs.\n\nSchema: `media` table has `altText` (nullable), `url`, `type`, `width`, `height`, `recordId` (FK). ~4,090 images total.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:06.504Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript Agents needing local-first personal knowledge management with Drizzle ORM integration.","zh":"适合需要本地优先个人知识管理并集成Drizzle ORM的TypeScript Agents。","ja":"Drizzle ORMを統合したローカルファーストのパーソナルな知識管理が必要なTypeScriptエージェントに最適。","ko":"Drizzle ORM 통합을 통해 로컬 우선 개인 지식 관리가 필요한 TypeScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de TypeScript que necesitan gestión de conocimiento personal de primera localización con integración de Drizzle ORM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents TypeScript nécessitant une gestion des connaissances personnelles en local avec intégration de Drizzle ORM.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript-Agents, die eine lokale Erstgestaltung der persönlichen Wissensverwaltung mit Drizzle ORM-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes TypeScript que necessitam de gestão de conhecimento pessoal local-first com integração Drizzle ORM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для TypeScript агентов, которым требуется локально-ориентированная система управления личными знаниями с интеграцией Drizzle ORM.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء TypeScript الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة معرفة شخصية محلية بالأولوية مع تكامل Drizzle ORM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Drizzle v2 query syntax for efficient reads and mutations, utilizing object-style where clauses, built-in with relations, and columns selection, while avoiding raw SQL and ensuring data consistency with upserts using .onConflictDoUpdate().","zh":"赋予代理使用Drizzle v2查询语法高效地读取和变异数据，利用对象风格的where子句、内置关系和列选择，同时避免原始SQL并通过.onConflictDoUpdate()确保数据一致性。","ja":"エージェントがDrizzle v2のクエリ構文を使用して効率的にデータを読み取りおよび変更できるようにし、オブジェクトスタイルのwhere子句、ビルトイン関係、列の選択を利用し、生のSQLを回避し、.onConflictDoUpdate()を使用してデータの一貫性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 Drizzle v2 쿼리 구문을 사용하여 효율적으로 데이터를 읽고 수정할 수 있도록 하며, 객체 스타일의 where 절, 내장 관계 및 열 선택을 사용하고, 원시 SQL을 피하고, .onConflictDoUpdate()를 사용하여 데이터 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la sintaxis de consulta de Drizzle v2 para lecturas y mutaciones eficientes, utilizando cláusulas where de estilo de objeto, relaciones integradas y selección de columnas, evitando SQL crudo y asegurando la consistencia de los datos con upserts utilizando .onConflictDoUpdate().","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter la syntaxe de requête Drizzle v2 pour des lectures et des mutations efficaces, en utilisant des clauses where de style objet, des relations intégrées et une sélection de colonnes, tout en évitant le SQL brut et en assurant la cohérence des données avec des upserts en utilisant .onConflictDoUpdate().","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die Abfragesyntax von Drizzle v2 für effiziente Lese- und Schreibvorgänge zu nutzen, indem Objekt-Style-Where-Klauseln, integrierte Beziehungen und Spaltenauswahl verwendet werden, während roher SQL vermieden und Datenkonsistenz mit Upserts unter Verwendung von .onConflictDoUpdate() sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a aproveitar a sintaxe de consulta Drizzle v2 para leituras e mutações eficientes, utilizando cláusulas where no estilo de objeto, com relações incorporadas e seleção de colunas, evitando SQL bruto e garantindo a consistência dos dados com upserts usando .onConflictDoUpdate().","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать синтаксис запросов Drizzle v2 для эффективного чтения и изменений, используя объектно-ориентированные условия where, встроенные отношения и выбор столбцов, избегая при этом raw SQL и обеспечивая согласованность данных с помощью операций upsert, используя .onConflictDoUpdate().","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من بناء جملة استعلام Drizzle v2 للقراءات والطفرات الفعالة، باستخدام عبارات where بأسلوب الكائن، المضمنة مع العلاقات، واختيار الأعمدة، مع تجنب SQL الخام وضمان اتساق البيانات مع عمليات upsert باستخدام .onConflictDoUpdate()."},"useCases":{"en":["Building local-first personal knowledge management systems","Optimizing database queries with Drizzle v2 syntax","Ensuring data consistency with upserts and .onConflictDoUpdate()","Supplementing global typescript-guidelines skill with rcr-backend"],"zh":["构建本地优先的个人知识管理系统","使用Drizzle v2语法优化数据库查询","使用upserts和.onConflictDoUpdate()确保数据一致性","补充全局typescript-guidelines技能的rcr-backend"],"ja":["ローカルファーストのパーソナルな知識管理システムの構築","Drizzle v2構文を使用したデータベースクエリの最適化","upsertsおよび.onConflictDoUpdate()を使用したデータの一貫性の確保","グローバルtypescript-guidelinesスキルのrcr-backendを補完"],"ko":["로컬 우선 개인 지식 관리 시스템 구축","Drizzle v2 구문을 사용한 데이터베이스 쿼리 최적화","upserts 및 .onConflictDoUpdate()를 사용한 데이터 일관성 보장","전역 typescript-guidelines 스킬의 rcr-backend 보완"],"es":["Construir sistemas de gestión de conocimiento personal de primera localización","Optimizar consultas de base de datos con la sintaxis de Drizzle v2","Asegurar la consistencia de los datos con upserts y .onConflictDoUpdate()","Complementar la habilidad global typescript-guidelines con rcr-backend"],"fr":["Construire des systèmes de gestion des connaissances personnelles en local","Optimiser les requêtes de base de données avec la syntaxe Drizzle v2","Assurer la cohérence des données avec des upserts et .onConflictDoUpdate()","Compléter la compétence typescript-guidelines globale avec rcr-backend"],"de":["Aufbau von Systemen für lokale Erstgestaltung der persönlichen Wissensverwaltung","Optimierung von Datenbankabfragen mit der Drizzle-v2-Syntax","Sicherstellung der Datenkonsistenz mit Upserts und .onConflictDoUpdate()","Ergänzung der globalen typescript-guidelines-Fähigkeit mit rcr-backend"],"pt":["Construção de sistemas locais de gestão de conhecimento pessoal com prioridade local","Otimização de consultas de banco de dados com a sintaxe Drizzle v2","Garantia da consistência dos dados com upserts e .onConflictDoUpdate()","Complementação da habilidade global typescript-guidelines com rcr-backend"],"ru":["Создание локально-ориентированных систем управления личными знаниями","Оптимизация запросов к базе данных с использованием синтаксиса Drizzle v2","Обеспечение согласованности данных с помощью операций upsert и .onConflictDoUpdate()","Дополнение глобального навыка typescript-guidelines с помощью rcr-backend"],"ar":["بناء أنظمة إدارة معرفة شخصية محلية بالأولوية","تحسين استعلامات قاعدة البيانات باستخدام بناء جملة Drizzle v2","ضمان اتساق البيانات مع عمليات upsert و .onConflictDoUpdate()","تكميل مهارة typescript-guidelines العالمية مع rcr-backend"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","Drizzle ORM v2 compatibility necessary","Local-first approach may limit scalability"],"zh":["需要TypeScript环境","需要Drizzle ORM v2兼容性","本地优先方法可能会限制可扩展性"],"ja":["TypeScript環境が必要","Drizzle ORM v2の互換性が必要","ローカルファーストアプローチは拡張性を制限する可能性がある"],"ko":["TypeScript 환경이 필요합니다","Drizzle ORM v2 호환성이 필요합니다","로컬 우선 방식은 확장성을 제한할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de TypeScript","Compatibilidad con Drizzle ORM v2 necesaria","El enfoque de primera localización puede limitar la escalabilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript","Compatibilité avec Drizzle ORM v2 nécessaire","L''approche en local peut limiter la scalabilité"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript-Umgebung","Kompatibilität mit Drizzle ORM v2 erforderlich","Der lokale Ansatz kann die Skalierbarkeit einschränken"],"pt":["Requer ambiente TypeScript","Necessária compatibilidade com Drizzle ORM v2","A abordagem local-first pode limitar a escalabilidade"],"ru":["Требует среду TypeScript","Необходима совместимость с Drizzle ORM v2","Локально-ориентированный подход может ограничивать масштабируемость"],"ar"