-ux-improve install","ui-ux-improve for AI agents","ui-ux-improve research mode","ui-ux-improve implement mode","ui-ux-improve trend research"],"zh":["UI/UX 优化","AI 驱动的分析","Docker 和 Atlas 迁移","应用程序优化","用户体验改善","AI 工具","UI/UX 改善工具"],"ja":["UI/UX 改善","AI ドリブンの分析","Docker と Atlas マイグレーション","アプリケーション最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス改善","AI エージェント","UI/UX 改善ツール"],"ko":["UI/UX 개선","AI 기반의 분석","Docker 및 Atlas 마이그레이션","애플리케이션 최적화","사용자 경험 개선","AI 도구","UI/UX 개선 도구"],"es":["herramientas de UI/UX","mejora de la experiencia del usuario","desarrollo local con Docker","gestión de esquemas de PostgreSQL","análisis de componentes","modos de investigación y implementación","desarrollo en tiempo real","optimización de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["outils UI/UX","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","développement local avec Docker","gestion des schémas de PostgreSQL","analyse de composants","modes de recherche et de mise en œuvre","développement en temps réel","optimisation de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["UI/UX-Tools","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","lokale Entwicklung mit Docker","Verwaltung von PostgreSQL-Schemata","Analyse von Komponenten","Forschungs- und Implementierungsmodi","Echtzeit-Entwicklung","Optimierung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["ui-ux-improve","análise de UI/UX","pesquisa de tendências","infraestrutura de desenvolvimento local","Docker","PostgreSQL","Atlas migrations","melhoria de interface","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["ui-ux-improve","анализ UI/UX","исследование тенденций","локальная инфраструктура разработки","Docker","PostgreSQL","Atlas migrations","улучшение интерфейса","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["ui-ux-improve","تحليل واجهة المستخدم وتصميمها","بحث الاتجاهات","بنية التطوير المحلية","Docker","PostgreSQL","Atlas migrations","تحسين واجهة المستخدم","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"specvital","repo":"infra","repoPath":"specvital/infra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.349Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-improve","description":"Research UI/UX improvements with trend analysis and generate actionable recommendations. Use when you need comprehensive UI/UX analysis and improvement suggestions.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Improvement Research Command\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nParse user input for:\n\n- **Focus Area**: Specific component, page, or feature to improve (optional)\n- **Mode**: `research` (default) or `implement` (immediate action)\n- **Scope**: `full` (entire app) or `targeted` (specific area)\n\nIf empty, analyze entire application with research mode.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis command combines AI-powered UI/UX analysis with real-time trend research to generate actionable improvement rec","body":"# UI/UX Improvement Research Command\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nParse user input for:\n\n- **Focus Area**: Specific component, page, or feature to improve (optional)\n- **Mode**: `research` (default) or `implement` (immediate action)\n- **Scope**: `full` (entire app) or `targeted` (specific area)\n\nIf empty, analyze entire application with research mode.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis command combines AI-powered UI/UX analysis with real-time trend research to generate actionable improvement recommendations.\n\n### Key Features\n\n- 🎨 **UI/UX Designer Agent**: Specialized analysis via ui-ux-designer agent\n- 🛠️ **Tech Stack Advisor Agent**: Library/framework recommendations via tech-stack-advisor agent\n- 🔍 **Trend Research**: Web search for current UI/UX trends (2024-2025)\n- 📊 **Gap Analysis**: Compare current state vs best practices\n- 📝 **Actionable Report**: Generate improvement roadmap in markdown\n- 🚀 **Optional Implementation**: Execute improvements on demand\n\n---\n\n## Execution Steps\n\n### 1. Context Gathering\n\n#### Analyze Project Structure\n\n**Detect Frontend Framework**:\n\n- Check `package.json` for: React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, Angular\n- Identify styling approach: Tailwind, CSS Modules, styled-components, CSS-in-JS\n- Find component library: shadcn/ui, MUI, Chakra, Radix\n\n**Explore UI Components**:\n\n- Use Glob to find component files (`**/*.tsx`, `**/components/**/*`)\n- Identify layout components (Header, Footer, Sidebar, Navigation)\n- Map page structure and routing\n\n**Analyze Current Design System**:\n\n- Color palette (CSS variables, theme config)\n- Typography (fonts, sizes, weights)\n- Spacing and layout patterns\n- Component consistency\n\n### 2. Invoke UI/UX Designer Agent\n\n**REQUIRED**: Use Task tool with `subagent_type: \"ui-ux-designer\"` to perform:\n\n- User experience evaluation\n- Accessibility assessment (WCAG guidelines)\n- Information architecture review\n- Component usability analysis\n- Mobile responsiveness check\n\n**Agent Prompt Template**:\n\n```\nAnalyze the UI/UX of this project focusing on:\n1. User journey and flow optimization\n2. Visual hierarchy and information architecture\n3. Accessibility compliance (WCAG 2.1 AA)\n4. Component reusability and consistency\n5. Responsive design patterns\n6. User interaction feedback patterns\n\nProject context:\n- Framework: {detected framework}\n- Styling: {styling approach}\n- Component library: {if any}\n- Focus area: {from user input or \"entire application\"}\n\nProvide specific, actionable recommendations with priority levels.\n```\n\n### 3. Invoke Tech Stack Advisor Agent\n\n**REQUIRED**: Use Task tool with `subagent_type: \"tech-stack-advisor\"` when:\n\n- Recommending new UI component libraries\n- Evaluating animation/interaction libraries\n- Comparing styling solutions\n- Suggesting accessibility tooling\n- Recommending state management for UI\n\n**Agent Prompt Template**:\n\n```\nEvaluate UI/UX related technologies for this project:\n\nCurrent stack:\n- Framework: {detected framework}\n- Styling: {styling approach}\n- Component library: {if any}\n\nEvaluate these categories based on project needs:\n1. Component libraries (shadcn/ui, Radix, Headless UI, etc.)\n2. Animation libraries (Framer Motion, React Spring, GSAP)\n3. Accessibility tools (axe-core, react-aria, etc.)\n4. Icon libraries (Lucide, Heroicons, Phosphor)\n5. Form libraries (React Hook Form, Formik, etc.)\n\nFor each recommendation:\n- Modernity score (0-10)\n- Stability score (0-10)\n- Bundle size impact\n- Migration complexity\n- Learning curve\n\nFocus on: {user focus area or \"general UI/UX improvement\"}\n```\n\n### 4. Trend Research (Web Search)\n\n**Search Queries** (use WebSearch tool):\n\n1. `\"UI/UX trends 2025\" best practices`\n2. `\"{framework} UI design patterns 2025\"` (e.g., \"React UI design patterns 2025\")\n3. `\"modern web design trends\" accessibility`\n4. `\"{component type} UX best practices\"` (if specific focus area)\n5. `\"best {library type} library 2025\"` (e.g., \"best React animation library 2025\")\n\n**Information to Gather**:\n\n- Current design trends (micro-interactions, glassmorphism, etc.)\n- Accessibility improvements\n- Performance optimization patterns\n- User engagement techniques\n- Mobile-first strategies\n- Emerging UI libraries and tools\n- Bundle size optimization techniques\n\n### 5. Gap Analysis\n\n**Compare and Identify**:\n\n- Current design vs trend recommendations\n- Missing accessibility features\n- Outdated patterns to modernize\n- Quick wins vs major refactors\n- Priority based on impact/effort ratio\n- Library/tool upgrades or additions needed\n\n### 6. Generate Report\n\n**Create**: `UI-UX-IMPROVEMENTS.md` at project root\n\n**Structure**:\n\n```markdown\n# UI/UX Improvement Recommendations\n\n> **Generated**: {YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm}\n> **Scope**: {full/targeted: specific area}\n> **Mode**: {research/implement}\n\n---\n\n## 📊 Current State Analysis\n\n### Framework & Stack\n\n- **Framework**: {detected}\n- **Styling**: {approach}\n- **Component Library**: {if any}\n\n### Strengths\n\n- {what''s working well}\n\n### Areas for Improvement\n\n- {identified issues}\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Trend Insights (2024-2025)\n\n### Design Trends\n\n- {trend 1}: {how it applies}\n- {trend 2}: {how it applies}\n\n### Accessibility Standards\n\n- {WCAG requirements}\n- {current compliance status}\n\n### UX Best Practices\n\n- {practice 1}\n- {practice 2}\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ Technology Recommendations\n\n### Recommended Libraries\n\n| Category   | Library   | Score  | Bundle Size | Why      |\n| ---------- | --------- | ------ | ----------- | -------- |\n| {category} | {library} | {X}/10 | {size}      | {reason} |\n\n### Migration Considerations\n\n- {library 1}: {migration notes}\n- {library 2}: {migration notes}\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Recommendations\n\n### Critical Priority\n\n#### 1. {Recommendation Title}\n\n**Problem**: {what''s wrong}\n**Solution**: {how to fix}\n**Impact**: {user benefit}\n**Effort**: {Low/Medium/High}\n**Files**: {affected files}\n\n### High Priority\n\n#### 2. {Recommendation Title}\n\n{same structure}\n\n### Medium Priority\n\n#### 3. {Recommendation Title}\n\n{same structure}\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Implementation Roadmap\n\n### Phase 1: Quick Wins (1-2 days)\n\n- [ ] {task 1}\n- [ ] {task 2}\n\n### Phase 2: Core Improvements (1-2 weeks)\n\n- [ ] {task 3}\n- [ ] {task 4}\n\n### Phase 3: Advanced Enhancements (2-4 weeks)\n\n- [ ] {task 5}\n- [ ] {task 6}\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Resources\n\n- {relevant documentation links}\n- {trend articles referenced}\n- {component library docs}\n```\n\n### 7. Implementation Mode (if requested)\n\nIf user specified `implement` mode or requests immediate action:\n\n1. Confirm scope with user before proceeding\n2. Start with Critical Priority items\n3. Make incremental changes with clear commits\n4. Verify each change doesn''t break existing functionality\n5. Update report with completed items\n\n---\n\n## Key Rules\n\n### ✅ MUST DO\n\n- **Always invoke ui-ux-designer agent** for expert analysis\n- **Always invoke tech-stack-advisor agent** for library/tool recommendations\n- **Perform web search** for current trends and library comparisons\n- **Analyze actual project code** (not assumptions)\n- **Provide specific file paths** in recommendations\n- **Include effort estimates** for each recommendation\n- **Evaluate bundle size impact** for library recommendations\n- **Generate report at project root** (`UI-UX-IMPROVEMENTS.md`)\n- **Consider accessibility** in all recommendations\n- **Prioritize by impact/effort ratio**\n\n### ❌ NEVER DO\n\n- Skip ui-ux-designer or tech-stack-advisor agent invocation\n- Make recommendations without code analysis\n- Suggest breaking changes without migration path\n- Ignore mobile/responsive considerations\n- Recommend trends that conflict with project constraints\n- Implement without user confirmation (in implement mode)\n- Generate vague or non-actionable recommendations\n- Recommend libraries without bundle size consideration\n- Suggest libraries with poor stability scores (<6/10)\n\n### 🎯 Quality Standards\n\nEach recommendation must include:\n\n1. **Clear Problem Statement**: What''s wrong and why it matters\n2. **Specific Solution**: How to fix with code examples if applicable\n3. **User Impact**: How it improves user experience\n4. **Effort Estimate**: Implementation complexity (Low/Medium/High)\n5. **File References**: Which files need changes\n\n---\n\n## Completion Report\n\nAfter execution, provide summary:\n\n```markdown\n## UI/UX Improvement Research Complete\n\n### 📊 Analysis Summary\n\n- **Components Analyzed**: {X}\n- **Pages Reviewed**: {Y}\n- **Trends Researched**: {Z}\n- **Libraries Evaluated**: {W}\n\n### 🎯 Recommendations\n\n- **Critical**: {N}\n- **High**: {M}\n- **Medium**: {K}\n\n### 📄 Generated Report\n\n`UI-UX-IMPROVEMENTS.md` created at project root.\n\n### Next Steps\n\n{Based on mode}:\n\n- **Research mode**: Review recommendations and run with `implement` to proceed\n- **Implement mode**: {X} improvements applied, {Y} remaining\n```\n\n---\n\n## Execute\n\nStart the UI/UX improvement research following the guidelines above.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:46.485Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing AI-powered UI/UX analysis and real-time trend research for improvement recommendations.","zh":"适合需要AI驱动的UI/UX分析和实时趋势研究以改进推荐的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがAIパワードのUI/UX分析とリアルタイムトレンドリサーチを使用して改善のための勧告を行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"AI 파워드 UI/UX 분석 및 실시간 트렌드 연구를 사용하여 개선 권장 사항을 생성하는 프런트 엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan análisis de UI/UX y investigación de tendencias en tiempo real con recomendaciones de mejora.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend qui ont besoin d''une analyse UI/UX et de recherches de tendances en temps réel pour des recommandations d''amélioration.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine AI-gestützte UI/UX-Analyse und Echtzeit-Trendforschung für Verbesserungsvorschläge benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de análise de UI/UX com inteligência artificial e pesquisa de tendências em tempo real para recomendações de melhoria.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим анализ UI/UX с помощью ИИ и исследование тенденций в реальном времени для рекомендаций по улучшению.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي وأبحاث الاتجاهات في الوقت الفعلي لتوصيات التحسين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate actionable improvement recommendations for specific components, pages, or features using real-time trend research and AI-powered UI/UX analysis, supporting modes like ''research'' and ''implement'' with scopes such as ''full'' or ''targeted''.","zh":"赋予代理生成针对特定组件、页面或功能的可操作的改进建议，使用实时趋势研究和AI驱动的UI/UX分析，支持诸如''research''和''implement''等模式，范围包括''full''或''targeted''。","ja":"エージェントが、リアルタイムのトレンドリサーチとAIパワードのUI/UX分析を使用して、特定のコンポーネント、ページ、または機能のためのアクション可能な改善のための勧告を生成できるようにします。''research''および''implement''などのモードをサポートし、''full''または''targeted''などの範囲を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 실시간 트렌드 연구 및 AI 파워드 UI/UX 분석을 사용하여 특정 구성 요소, 페이지 또는 기능에 대한 작동 가능한 개선 권장 사항을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. ''research'' 및 ''implement''와 같은 모드를 지원하며 ''full'' 또는 ''targeted''와 같은 범위를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar recomendaciones de mejora accionables para componentes, páginas o características específicas utilizando investigaciones de tendencias en tiempo real y análisis de UI/UX con tecnologías de inteligencia artificial, y admite modos como ''investigación'' e ''implementación'' con alcances como ''completo'' o ''dirigido''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des recommandations d''amélioration actionnables pour des composants, des pages ou des fonctionnalités spécifiques en utilisant des recherches de tendances en temps réel et une analyse UI/UX alimentée par l''IA, et prend en charge des modes tels que ''recherche'' et ''mise en œuvre'' avec des portées telles que ''complet'' ou ''ciblé''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, handhabbare Verbesserungsvorschläge für bestimmte Komponenten, Seiten oder Funktionen zu generieren, indem sie Echtzeit-Trendforschung und AI-gestützte UI/UX-Analyse verwenden, und unterstützt Modi wie ''Forschung'' und ''Implementierung'' mit Umfängen wie ''vollständig'' oder ''gezielt''.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem recomendações de melhoria viáveis para componentes, páginas ou recursos específicos, utilizando pesquisa de tendências em tempo real e análise de UI/UX com inteligência artificial, suportando modos como ''pesquisa'' e ''implementação'' com escopos como ''completo'' ou ''direcionado''.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать действенные рекомендации по улучшению для конкретных компонентов, страниц или функций, используя исследование тенденций в реальном времени и анализ UI/UX с помощью ИИ, поддерживая режимы, такие как ''исследование'' и ''реализация'', с областями, такими как ''полный'' или ''целевой''.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توليد توصيات تحسين قابلة للتنفيذ لمكونات أو صفحات أو ميزات محددة باستخدام أبحاث الاتجاهات في الوقت الفعلي وتحليل واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، مع دعم أوضاع مثل ''البحث'' و ''التطبيق'' مع نطاقات مثل ''كامل'' أو ''موجه''."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing entire applications for UI/UX improvements","Generating targeted improvement recommendations for specific components","Conducting real-time trend research for informed design decisions"],"zh":["分析整个应用程序以进行UI/UX改进","为特定组件生成有针对性的改进建议","进行实时趋势研究以实现明智的设计决策"],"ja":["UI/UXの改善のために全アプリケーションを分析する","特定のコンポーネントのためのターゲットを絞った改善のための勧告を生成する","情報に基づいたデザインの決定のためにリアルタイムのトレンドリサーチを実施する"],"ko":["UI/UX 개선을 위해 전체 애플리케이션을 분석한다","특정 구성 요소에 대한 타겟을 좁힌 개선 권장 사항을 생성한다","정보에 기반한 디자인 결정에 대한 실시간 트렌드 연구를 수행한다"],"es":["Análisis de aplicaciones completas para mejoras de UI/UX","Generación de recomendaciones de mejora dirigidas para componentes específicos","Realización de investigaciones de tendencias en tiempo real para decisiones de diseño informadas"],"fr":["Analyse d''applications complètes pour améliorer l''UI/UX","Génération de recommandations d''amélioration ciblées pour des composants spécifiques","Conduite de recherches de tendances en temps réel pour des décisions de conception éclairées"],"de":["Analyse von gesamten Anwendungen für UI/UX-Verbesserungen","Erstellung gezielter Verbesserungsvorschläge für bestimmte Komponenten","Durchführung von Echtzeit-Trendforschung für fundierte Designentscheidungen"],"pt":["Analisar aplicativos inteiros para melhorias de UI/UX","Gerar recomendações de melhoria direcionadas para componentes específicos","Realizar pesquisas de tendências em tempo real para decisões de design informadas"],"ru":["Анализировать все приложения для улучшения UI/UX","Генерировать целевые рекомендации по улучшению для конкретных компонентов","Проводить исследование тенденций в реальном времени для обоснованных решений по дизайну"],"ar":["تحليل التطبيقات الكاملة لتحسين واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم","توليد توصيات تحسين موجهة لمكونات محددة","إجراء أبحاث الاتجاهات في الوقت الفعلي لاتخاذ قرارات تصميم مدروسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for focus area, mode, and scope","Limited to UI/UX improvement analysis and recommendations"],"zh":["需要用户输入焦点区域、模式和范围","仅限于UI/UX改进分析和建议"],"ja":["焦点領域、モード、範囲のユーザー入力を必要とする","UI/UXの改善のための分析と勧告に限定される"],"ko":["초점 영역, 모드, 범위의 사용자 입력이 필요하다","UI/UX 개선을 위한 분석 및 권장 사항으로 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere entrada de usuario para el área de enfoque, el modo y el alcance","Limitado al análisis y las recomendaciones de mejora de UI/UX"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la zone de concentration, le mode et la portée","Limité à l''analyse et aux recommandations d''amélioration de l''UI/UX"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzereingaben für den Fokus, den Modus und den Umfang","Begrenzt auf die Analyse und Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung von UI/UX"],"pt":["Requer entrada do usuário para área de foco, modo e escopo","Limitado à análise e recomendações de melhoria de UI/UX"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для области фокуса, режима и объема","Ограничен анализом и рекомендациями по улучшению UI/UX"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لمنطقة التركيز والوضع والنطاق","محدود بالتحليل وتوصيات التحسين لواجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f8805caf12b5bb62d92b47b071eac6e30267915c83aba10a1b48a5494731f032","qualityScore":45}');
